WEBVTT

00:01:28.829 --> 00:01:33.288
I would much rather have people focus
on character and, you know,

00:01:33.329 --> 00:01:37.829
trying to build their generosity, their
integrity, their commitment to justice,

00:01:38.371 --> 00:01:41.371
their humility. And I wonder if you could
talk to me a little bit about

00:01:41.371 --> 00:01:43.788
whether you think we've
lost our way a bit

00:01:43.954 --> 00:01:49.496
and character has been too little in
focus or too far in the background

00:01:49.496 --> 00:01:52.163
or whether you think happiness deserves
the attention it's gotten?

00:01:52.204 --> 00:01:57.746
Well, I think my focus would be neither
happiness nor character.

00:01:58.413 --> 00:02:04.038
It would be misery. And I think
that there is a task